## 2. Canonical package layout (as observed)

Per bounded context `<ctx>`:

```
<root>.<ctx>
├── domain
│   ├── model
│   │   ├── aggregates      X.java          plain class, extends AbstractDomainAggregateRoot<X>
│   │   ├── entities        Y.java          owned by an aggregate, no independent lifecycle
│   │   ├── valueobjects    Z.java          record or enum, immutable, self-validating
│   │   ├── commands        XxxCommand.java record, one per write intent
│   │   ├── queries         GetXxxQuery.java record, one per read intent
│   │   └── events          XxxEvent.java   domain event record
│   ├── exceptions          XxxNotFoundException.java
│   └── repositories        XRepository.java        PORT, interface, domain types only
├── application
│   ├── commandservices     XCommandService.java    PORT, interface (inbound)
│   ├── queryservices       XQueryService.java      PORT, interface (inbound)
│   ├── acl                 XContextFacadeImpl.java implementation of another context's facade
│   └── internal
│       ├── commandservices XCommandServiceImpl.java   @Service
│       ├── queryservices   XQueryServiceImpl.java     @Service
│       ├── eventhandlers   XxxEventHandler.java
│       └── outboundservices
│           ├── acl         ExternalXService.java   calls another context's facade
│           ├── hashing     HashingService.java     OUTBOUND port
│           └── tokens      TokenService.java       OUTBOUND port
├── infrastructure
│   ├── persistence.jpa
│   │   ├── entities        XPersistenceEntity.java     extends AuditableAbstractPersistenceEntity
│   │   ├── repositories    XPersistenceRepository.java extends JpaRepository, @Repository
│   │   ├── assemblers      XPersistenceAssembler.java  final class, private ctor, static only
│   │   ├── converters      ZPersistenceConverter.java  AttributeConverter for a value object
│   │   ├── embeddables     ZPersistenceEmbeddable.java @Embeddable for a multi-field VO
│   │   └── adapters        XRepositoryImpl.java        implements the domain port, @Repository
│   ├── hashing.<impl>      implementation of the outbound hashing port
│   ├── tokens.<impl>       implementation of the outbound token port
│   └── authorization.<impl> filters, entry points, security configuration
└── interfaces
    ├── rest                XsController.java       @RestController
    │   ├── resources       XResource.java          record DTO
    │   └── transform       XResourceFromEntityAssembler.java
    │                       XCommandFromResourceAssembler.java
    ├── acl                 XContextFacade.java     interface other contexts call
    └── events              XxxIntegrationEvent.java
```

`shared/` mirrors the same tree and holds only what **two or more** contexts use. Observed members:

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `shared/domain/model/aggregates/AbstractDomainAggregateRoot` | base for all aggregates; supplies domain-event registration only. **No JPA.** |
| `shared/infrastructure/persistence/jpa/entities/AuditableAbstractPersistenceEntity` | `@MappedSuperclass` holding `id`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt` and the auditing listener |
| `shared/infrastructure/persistence/jpa/configuration/strategy/...PhysicalNamingStrategy` | snake_case + pluralised table names |
| `shared/infrastructure/documentation/openapi/configuration/...` | OpenAPI config |
| `shared/interfaces/rest/GlobalExceptionHandler` | `@RestControllerAdvice` |
| `shared/interfaces/rest/resources/*` | `ErrorResource`, `MessageResource` |
| `shared/application/result/{Result, ApplicationError}` | typed success/failure return |

